  <string name="download_library_confirm">Effects will stop while shaders are checked on this device. Failed presets will be excluded and listed in a report. Checking may take several minutes. Download the complete Slang shader library directly from libretro/slang-shaders on GitHub? The current library is about 53 MiB to download and 70 MiB installed; allow at least 150 MiB free. All presets, shader files, includes, textures and original notices are kept. Categories follow the upstream folders. Some presets require features this renderer does not support. Downloads use your internet connection; screen captures are never uploaded.</string>
  <string name="library_help">Download once, then use the library offline. Categories follow Libretro’s source folders. Not every Slang preset is supported.</string>
